flowchart TD
  Clients[Web clients / REST applications / MCP agents] --> ALB[HTTPS ALB]
  ALB --> Web[Next.js web / Fargate]
  ALB --> API[API / Fargate: auth, quota, jobs, Decider]
  API --> CV[Standard backend: OpenCV 5 sidecar and pinned YOLOX]
  API -->|Optional selected backend| COOL[Separately provisioned licensed COOL / Graviton service]
  API -->|Consented model calls| Bedrock[Approved Bedrock planner and assessment models]
  API --> Data[DynamoDB jobs, usage, settings / private S3 evidence where used]
  API -->|Separate asynchronous incident path| Queue[SQS and dead-letter queue]
  Queue --> Worker[Fargate worker + vision sidecar / optional AI]
  Worker --> Data
  Worker --> Bedrock
  Worker --> SES[Configured notifications]
  Operations[CloudFormation / IAM / Secrets Manager / CloudWatch] -.-> API
  Operations -.-> Worker
